Subject: [EXPERIMENT] ASoC: WSA884x: observe a prepared PA-off sink bank

In the prepare-only opt-in fixture, verify channel enable and Golden
SIMPLE fields on both real codecs in the current bank. No writes or
changes to the active PA/clock paths.

